ister atmosphere. Kind of like she's hearing sinister voices of the shadows trying to take over her.\nReference idea:\nhttps://twitter.com/Rolua_N/status/1535900631147241472?s=20&t=jznTq3jNHRNxQ0lgwDtDMg\n\nIf it's okay, please draw this on a 16:9 ratio in a vertical way. May I ask permission to use this on SNS like Twitter, Twitch & YouTube? Is it also possible to receive a PSD with the background, character and signature separated?\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1V0YaYVmkfBFAFr_ofVE8BJs70xfr6Uk5?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kyoudou_nanase/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e4391c7/uploads/origins/8604732f-9e6f-4709-a6e2-ce8d10d5fa75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=15422a692f606f32ca5b0b16e4b4386d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6e4391c7/uploads/origins/8604732f-9e6f-4709-a6e2-ce8d10d5fa75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=15422a692f606f32ca5b0b16e4b4386d, https://si.imgix.net/6e4391c7/uploads/origins/8604732f-9e6f-4709-a6e2-ce8d10d5fa75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=96cf4bb365c55e8361f3eebc39aa8a67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6e4391c7/uploads/origins/8604732f-9e6f-4709-a6e2-ce8d10d5fa75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6ab838300ae0a77b2069638449303773 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2321765, "client_id": 946988, "nc": 145